OL,3,GNEWSAVote on Irish schools law set to  
OL,4,Afall after Stormont veto               
OL,6,FA proposed law on Irish-medium         
OL,7,Feducation is expected to fall on       
OL,8,FTuesday during a vote in the Northern  
OL,9,FIreland Assembly after unionists       
OL,10,Fdeployed a Stormont veto.              
OL,12,FThe bill, brought forward by Sinn Fein 
OL,13,Fassembly member Pat Sheehan, would     
OL,14,Frequire Stormont's Department of       
OL,15,FEducation (DoE) to prepare a workforce 
OL,16,Fplan on schools in the sector.         
OL,18,FA vote during its final stage was      
OL,19,Fpostponed a fortnight ago after the    
OL,20,FDemocratic Unionist Party (DUP) tabled 
OL,21,Fa petition of concern with the support 
OL,22,Fof other unionists.                    
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
