OL,3,GNEWSAVote on Irish schools law set to  
OL,4,Afall after Stormont veto               
OL,6,FIt means the legislation will require  
OL,7,Fcross-community support from a majority
OL,8,Fof both unionists and nationalists in  
OL,9,Fthe Stormont assembly chamber.         
